WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, you know who twatted me
last night?

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.069
-Who twatted you?
-Who twatted me on the Twitter?

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sean Hannity
is obsessed with me.

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, so last night,
he wrote another blog

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.642
about my freaking Trump mask
picture with the ketchup --

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:12.112 align:start size:94% position:6%
you all know the picture --
and changed my life.

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:15.348 align:start size:94% position:6%
Anyway, so he does another --
another blog about it.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:16.282 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I wrote to him.
I said,

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:18.918
"I don't know if you're gonna do
very well in jail,

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:20.086 line:92%
because someone like you --

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:22.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
the rate of recidivism
is going to be very high."

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:23.656 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-Yeah.

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.392 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Recidivism is a good thing
to knock him on. Yeah.

00:00:25.392 --> 00:00:26.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's a good word, right?
-Yeah.

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And, also, I've actually
performed in prisons,

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:30.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm telling you --
they would not go for Sean.

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:31.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-Like, he's not their type.

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:32.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Okay.

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:33.433 line:92%
-But he's going. He's going.

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:35.869
Priebus and all of them --
they're all going to jail.

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Now, so, let's talk again
about this photo.

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:41.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
Obviously, you know,
you have a mask, a Trump mask.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:42.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You guys know the picture,
right?

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:43.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, it's --
-Okay. All right, all right.

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:45.512
-It looks like you're holding up
a -- a severed head,

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:48.048 align:start size:94% position:6%
but no one thought
it was a real severed head.

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:48.882 align:start size:94% position:6%
I --
-No.

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:52.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
First of all, Matt Lauer of --
oh, sorry -- NBC.

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:54.687 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Of all people.

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:56.456 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Right? That one.

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:58.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
All right, so...

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:00.427 align:start size:94% position:6%
Allegedly. Allegedly.
-Allegedly.

00:01:00.427 --> 00:01:03.329 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you, Kathy. Allegedly.
-Allegedly. Allegedly.

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:05.532
So, he calls me on my cellphone,
and I'm thinking,

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:07.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
"How the hell does Matt Lauer
have my cellphone?"

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, yeah,
things got so crazy that day.

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:10.437 line:92%
I got calls from everybody.

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:13.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, of course, you know,
someone called and said,

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.707
"What if --"
you knew who Daniel Pearl was --

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.476
so I don't mean to bring
the room down, but someone said,

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:18.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
"What if Daniel Pearl's mother
saw this?"

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:20.313 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I've performed
in Iraq and Afghanistan,

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.582 size:75% position:38%
places the president
can't find on a map,

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:23.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
nor has he been.
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:26.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so, I really truly, truly
didn't think

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:27.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
people would make
the connection.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:30.657
I just thought -- all I could
think of was everything from,

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:34.427 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know,
a spoof of Medusa and Perseus

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:37.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
to him saying famously
to Megyn Kelly --

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:38.932 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and I'm no fan -- sorry.

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:39.899 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
But, anyway...

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:40.700 line:92%
You know, remember that one?

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
"And by the way Santa Claus
is white."

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:45.105
Calm down, girl. You don't know.
You weren't there.

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:45.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
All right, so...

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't forget.
I don't forget a single thing.

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:49.375
-Yeah, no.
-I don't forget a single thing.

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:50.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Where?
-Anyway...

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:51.578 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you mean the North Pole?
Is that where --

00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:52.712 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-No, Megyn Kelly went on --

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:55.982 size:88% position:44%
she -- she went on a --
-I remember. I remember.

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:58.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She went on a rant
about Santa Claus being white.

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:00.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
And my mother loved it,
'cause, you know...

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:01.921 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:03.756 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
All right, so...

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:04.791 line:92%
By the way, it took me two hours

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:07.160 align:start size:94% position:6%
to convince my mother
I wasn't in ISIS that day.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
I swear to God -- my mother --
she's like,

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:11.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Why did you join ISIS,
damn it?"

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:13.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
"Mom, Mom.

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:14.901 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm 57 years old.
I'm on the road.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:15.602 line:92%
I'm trying to do a tour."

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:18.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Of all the things --
I was watching my Fox News,

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:20.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they said
that ISIS is terrible."

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:21.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
I go, "Mom, I'm not --"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:24.410
All right, so it was as crazy --
as crazy as you would imagine.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.213 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it got so crazy,
I really did start to think,

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:28.248 line:92%
"I've got to make this funny."

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:31.050
And so someone named Jim Carrey
called me.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Audience oohs ]
-Oooh.

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:34.087 line:92%
-Yeah. Don't be such an [bleep]

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:36.556
Ooh, sell it. Sell it. Sell it.
-[ Chuckling ] Okay, sorry.

00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:37.891 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh! Oh, wait.
Do it again.

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:39.325 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, anyway,
Jim Carrey called me.

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:41.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Gasps ]
[ Audience oohs ]

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:43.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my gosh.
And the reason I bring that up

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:44.931
is that I don't
really even know him that well,

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:46.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
but it was sweet of him
to reach out.

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:47.400
And he said the greatest thing.
He goes,

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.503
"Kathy, you're the most famous
comedian in the world today."

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:53.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm sobbing,
"Oh, for the wrong reasons."

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:54.240 size:81% position:41% line:92%
He goes, "No. Use it."

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.242
And so now I'm naming the tour,
and I'll be playing

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:57.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
Carnegie Hall
and Radio City Music Hall

00:02:57.844 --> 00:03:01.014
at the Kathy Griffin "Laugh
Your Head Off" World Tour.

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:03.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There you go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:05.185 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
So...

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:06.719 line:92%
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:08.321 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I...

00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:09.455 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I do want to --

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:12.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, in no way was it
a proportional response,

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:13.359 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
but do you look --

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:14.727 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, obviously,
it was done to provoke,

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:16.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then
you successfully provoked.

00:03:16.729 --> 00:03:18.198
Do you look back at all and say,
"Oh, gosh.

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:21.201
There was a better photo
to take, or not this one"?

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:23.536 size:81% position:41%
-I wish I had, like --
Okay, so first of all,

00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:24.404 line:92%
I didn't really think about it.

00:03:24.404 --> 00:03:26.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
And honestly,
I sent a friend of mine out

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:29.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
for, like, a mask
at a Halloween store for $10.

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:30.376 line:92%
And then I got all the ketchup

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:32.078
because I kept thinking
about him saying at the debate,

00:03:32.078 --> 00:03:34.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Blood coming out of her eye.
Out of her what --"

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:34.948 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And I'm like,

00:03:34.948 --> 00:03:36.849
"How many men have said that
crap to you over your life?"

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:38.885 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I was triggered.
I admit it triggered.

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:40.486 size:75% position:38%
Triggered snowflake.
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:42.989 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so, I wanted to shame him.
I wanted to shame him.

00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:45.658
He's such a misogynist, and
his policies are so disgusting.

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:49.229
And for the rights of women and
LGBT folks and people of color,

00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:50.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"This guy's going down."

00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:53.266 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, granted,
it was a little soon.

00:03:53.266 --> 00:03:54.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]
Like, I'm just saying

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:55.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
a lot of people
have actually said, like,

00:03:55.768 --> 00:03:59.539
if this had been post-Weinstein,
or post-"Me Too," maybe --

00:03:59.539 --> 00:04:00.873 align:start size:94% position:6%
maybe it wouldn't have been
so bad.

00:04:00.873 --> 00:04:02.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
But when you do
something like that --

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:04.777 size:78% position:39%
I really did just try
to make a statement.

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:05.878 size:88% position:44% line:92%
And I truly didn't think

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:07.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
people would think
it was an actual severed head.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.916 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I'd go to a severed head
warehouse or something.

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:11.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughing ] Right, yeah.
-So, I mean --

00:04:11.651 --> 00:04:12.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, also, I didn't like --
you know,

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:15.488
I didn't know I was just part of
the Trump, like, wood chipper.

00:04:15.488 --> 00:04:17.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I should have known,
because at that time,

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:19.626 size:88% position:44%
he had only done it to,
like, political figures.

00:04:19.626 --> 00:04:22.095
But what he did to me --
I just want you guys to know --

00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:22.695 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
it's historic.

00:04:22.695 --> 00:04:25.331
It's never happened where a
sitting United States President

00:04:25.331 --> 00:04:26.566 align:start size:94% position:6%
has used the power
of the Oval Office,

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:29.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
the first family --
oh, that group.

00:04:29.769 --> 00:04:33.706
Let's not start with the sons,
Date Rape and Eddie Munster.

00:04:33.706 --> 00:04:34.274 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:34.274 --> 00:04:36.876
All right, so,
I've really lightened up a lot.

00:04:36.876 --> 00:04:38.278 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have.
I mean they've really --

00:04:38.278 --> 00:04:41.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know,
come out of your shell again.

00:04:41.281 --> 00:04:42.615 line:92%
We need to see Kathy Griffin.

00:04:42.615 --> 00:04:45.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know. I'm so shy.
All right, so...

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:47.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, you know,
and then the Fox News machine,

00:04:47.053 --> 00:04:50.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
and TMZ was recording my tour
cancelations in real time

00:04:50.757 --> 00:04:51.557 size:88% position:44% line:92%
because of bomb threats,

00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:53.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
which I later found out
were robocalls.

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:54.927 line:92%
Like, I honestly didn't know

00:04:54.927 --> 00:04:56.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
they had this apparatus
already in place.

00:04:56.562 --> 00:04:58.197
So, they just kind of put me in,
like,

00:04:58.197 --> 00:04:59.966 align:start size:94% position:6%
the Colin Kaepernick
wood chipper,

00:04:59.966 --> 00:05:01.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they bring me up on Fox,
like,

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:03.636 align:start size:94% position:6%
whenever it's Mueller time.
[ Light laughter ]

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:04.537 line:92%
You know, they bring me up.

00:05:04.537 --> 00:05:05.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
They bring up,
you know, Maxine Waters.

00:05:05.905 --> 00:05:08.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, so I'm now just in their
group of people to go for.

00:05:08.775 --> 00:05:11.377
-And what was -- you were doing
your show overseas.

00:05:11.377 --> 00:05:12.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you were --
-Well, I wasn't.

00:05:12.545 --> 00:05:14.580
I had --
I was driven overseas, frankly.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, I was in the middle
of a 50-city tour.

00:05:16.382 --> 00:05:18.618
And, you know, I just --
this is all I do, you guys.

00:05:18.618 --> 00:05:19.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't have a network
or a studio.

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:23.256
I go and tell my [bleep] jokes
town to town and hope you laugh.

00:05:23.256 --> 00:05:25.058 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
And...

00:05:25.058 --> 00:05:26.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughs ]
You know.

00:05:26.192 --> 00:05:28.094 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You're like --
I've always said

00:05:28.094 --> 00:05:31.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're like Johnny Appleseed
for [bleep]

00:05:31.064 --> 00:05:32.398 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
-Yeah.

00:05:32.398 --> 00:05:32.932 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.932 --> 00:05:35.401
-Don't make me emotional.
Do not make me emotional.

00:05:35.401 --> 00:05:37.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause that was touching.
I'm only human.

00:05:37.904 --> 00:05:41.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
And so, yeah,
I called my stand-up agent,

00:05:41.007 --> 00:05:44.043
and I said, "This is a weird way
to route a tour,

00:05:44.043 --> 00:05:45.411 size:88% position:44% line:92%
but can you just send me

00:05:45.411 --> 00:05:46.913 align:start size:94% position:6%
to countries
where they hate Trump?"

00:05:46.913 --> 00:05:50.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
Two weeks later, I had
15 countries and 23 cities.

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:51.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
So I -- I --

00:05:51.551 --> 00:05:53.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
It was heaven. It was heaven.

00:05:53.953 --> 00:05:57.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I -- I certainly --
I'm -- You know,

00:05:57.256 --> 00:05:59.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm so happy
you're doing shows here again.

00:05:59.659 --> 00:06:01.828 align:start size:94% position:6%
I look forward
to seeing how they go and...

00:06:01.828 --> 00:06:02.895 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Me too. Seriously.

00:06:02.895 --> 00:06:04.464 size:75% position:38%
-And I'm glad to see
you're doing well,

00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:05.631 align:start size:94% position:6%
and thanks so much
for coming back, Kathy.

00:06:05.631 --> 00:06:07.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's always a pleasure.
-Well, thank you.

